# Runtime OpenTofu artifacts. State lives ONLY in the kubernetes-backend Secret
# tfstate-default-openbao-config (ns secret), never in git. secret:configure writes
# zz_backend.tf at apply time and removes it after. .terraform.lock.hcl is
# intentionally NOT ignored — it pins the providers for reproducible inits.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
zz_backend.tf
# network cluster OIDC issuer + JWKS, regenerated by `network:bootstrap` and
# auto-loaded by `secret:configure`. Public key material (safe), but treated as
# regenerated config, not source — it changes when the network cluster is recreated
# (SPEC R5). terranetes gets these via the Configuration's variables on the ref flip.
*.auto.tfvars.json
